# 48. CONTACT FORM

The current contact form depends on Supabase.

Refactor it so missing Supabase configuration does not produce an uncontrolled 500.

Expected behavior when unconfigured:

* UI remains functional
* submission is rejected gracefully
* no fake success
* server logs an appropriate configuration warning
* secrets are not exposed

