# 52. NO MOCK PRODUCTION SUCCESS

This rule is critical.

If Supabase is not configured:

Do NOT make authentication appear successful.

Do NOT make contact submissions appear stored.

Do NOT make projects appear created.

Do NOT make products appear provisioned.

Do NOT make infrastructure appear deployed.

Development fixtures are permitted only if clearly isolated and labeled.

