# FINAL ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE

Atlas is becoming a control plane over applications, products, subscriptions, entitlements, deployments, and cloud infrastructure.

The architecture should ultimately support:

CUSTOMER

→ ATLAS ACCOUNT

→ ORGANIZATION

→ SUBSCRIPTION

→ ENTITLEMENTS

→ PROJECT

→ APPLICATION / ATLAS PRODUCT

→ ENVIRONMENT

→ PROVISIONING JOB

